[{"client_msg_id":"587fe65f-3e11-45da-be96-2c88f5cdd56f","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"鉄鍋は底が丸いのでIHに向かないのです……。","ts":"1622037910.360800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BpMM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"16fab60c-8b99-4f02-9645-1162935635a5","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"まえの家IHでしたけど鉄フライパンつかってました","ts":"1622037776.360400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LDm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"af7ef89b-3590-430d-9d85-98482d0f7946","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"それはどうなんだろう","ts":"1622036853.358200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"dajare","count":2,"users":["U8996GYBF","U01U44T1FK2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P4E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0ec0fcb1-a6c8-4b85-8bf5-f9981cf649bb","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"金属繋がりで、銅製のケトルがあるんですが取ってまで銅なのでタオルがないとどうしようもないのであまりオススメはできません(ダジャレじゃないよ)","ts":"1622036823.358100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"rolling_on_the_floor_laughing","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]},{"name":"dajare","count":1,"users":["UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rkM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ce57d35-7d26-40f6-9818-7b29bca5af6a","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"同じ理由で鉄瓶にも手を出したんですけど、うっかり錆させてしまって依頼、手を出せていないです。","ts":"1622036582.357900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":1,"users":["U01U44T1FK2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/QGFr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"53e044d6-cbc6-4cf1-ad5f-25affe060a63","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"私も育てるってところで鉄鍋使ってました。今はIHなので人に譲りました。","ts":"1622036542.357300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8T27r"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d2859682-2f06-4ff1-9702-1bc274222514","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"\u0026gt; 実は洗剤で洗っちゃっても良いらしいですね。\n\u0026gt; \n汚れが気になるときとか、水で洗い流せねぇなって時は洗剤使ってますね\n鉄の場合、テフロンにない、育てるって発想があるのでそれも好きです","ts":"1622036394.356300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UDwd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"738fd227-e5a8-4ecf-96f6-356839dcfd5b","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"(ランチにスクランブルエッグした画像あったけどこの時間なので自主規制)","ts":"1622036235.356200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"gopher","count":1,"users":["U01D9BALEKU"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WlPGv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2abb8c5b-7228-4a4f-ac3a-5536ec91e018","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"スキレットも一人暮らしだとめっちゃ使えますね。","ts":"1622036064.355200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"79gX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7fee7d0d-3590-4e10-98cc-5dfb1de9ce6a","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"\u003chttps://note.com/travelingfoodlab/n/n83ae14a2cf5c\u003e","ts":"1622036028.354500","attachments":[{"fallback":"note（ノート）: 鉄のフライパンの再生とメンテナンス｜樋口直哉(TravelingFoodLab.)｜note","id":1,"title":"鉄のフライパンの再生とメンテナンス｜樋口直哉(TravelingFoodLab.)｜note","title_link":"https://note.com/travelingfoodlab/n/n83ae14a2cf5c","text":"知人の家で料理をしていたところ「最近、鉄のフライパンで卵を焼くとくっつんだよね」という話が。ちょっと見せてもらいましょう。 こ、これは良くない状態です。このフライパンで調理をすれば焦げ付く事態が想像できます。その理由は表面に焦げなどの汚れが付着しているから。 そもそもなぜフライパンに食材がくっつくのか、を復習しておきましょう。フライパンの表面を顕微鏡でのぞくと、目に見えないヒビや突起があります。このでこぼこがフライパンに食材がこびりつく物理的な原因です。 タンパク質を加熱するとお互いに反応しあって、網状組織をつくるわけですが、この時、鍋の金属イオンとも反応します。例えば","image_url":"https://assets.st-note.com/production/uploads/images/19507382/rectangle_large_type_2_28ea8005e6bf705e4255e633d22f9818.jpeg?fit=bounds\u0026quality=85\u0026width=1280","blocks":null,"service_name":"note（ノート）","service_icon":"https://d291vdycu0ht11.cloudfront.net/nuxt/static/metaicon/apple-touch-icon.png","from_url":"https://note.com/travelingfoodlab/n/n83ae14a2cf5c","original_url":"https://note.com/travelingfoodlab/n/n83ae14a2cf5c"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZBX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"304575ef-49b0-4487-82b4-62f6418c0e47","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"昔使ってましたけど、洗い方悪いのか、裏側にどんどん焦げついた何かが溜まってくのが気になってました。実は洗剤で洗っちゃっても良いらしいですね。","ts":"1622036007.353900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Fdda"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b18c05aa-3c54-4f93-a82e-3e6741585dc8","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"重たいけどちゃんとメイラード反応させられるのでおすすめです\nあと鉄鍋は洗剤使っちゃいけなくて、たわしごしごしだから洗うのそんなに面倒じゃない！","ts":"1622035916.352400","edited":{"user":"U01U44T1FK2","ts":"1622035944.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9=4F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eff903ac-69d1-4ea0-b004-0eabcb2f951f","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"鉄フライパンで作る目玉焼きがうまい！","ts":"1622035763.352100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"fried_egg","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]},{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["U01D9BALEKU","UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zx5q8"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U0218A9LKTJ","text":"\u003c@U0218A9LKTJ\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1622033084.351700","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"96cecc4e-9a0c-4f1f-9e80-c1535b589c91","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"洗剤、人類の叡智","ts":"1622031697.351300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sponge","count":2,"users":["U022XK5866Q","U01U44T1FK2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1XT5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"23407002-512e-43f3-83d9-de8effad59ac","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"あらった","ts":"1622031687.351200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dldvq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1a76b2b1-41e7-4b9c-892b-6d556447a9b8","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"最近、グリルで肉を焼くのめっちゃうまくなってて、低温調理の出番がなくなった。","ts":"1622030541.351100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bM59"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U023040U953","text":"\u003c@U023040U953\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1622030159.350700","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"c35b9d5a-baef-4af5-a292-9f94a11ca258","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"IHにして、食後の食器をそこに置くと料理自体が始められなくなるというハック(?)はあるにはありますが....","ts":"1622029200.350300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qBfIB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c98375c1-9e3f-4946-9565-833ddec811f2","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"洗い物しないと飯食えなくして自分に洗わせる作戦は前試したことありますが、自分が思ってたより我慢強かったので即崩壊しました","ts":"1622029081.349700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"fuita","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U7IlY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eee30edd-d2c8-411a-9bc5-d478b0f2c7d9","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"対策があだになってるｗ","ts":"1622029058.349600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7mrPD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4d8ad8ca-ea80-4f89-a2e6-df57c7e4ec2a","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"積むとﾏﾁﾞﾑﾘ…ってなる（なってる）","ts":"1622029008.349000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yqN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1de84fa1-c2cf-4bb0-9666-30ad043cd3f0","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"その対策として食器ナイフフォークは２セット買った","ts":"1622028985.348900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mTWtM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f1c33b89-ee71-49af-b15a-856b2975a8bc","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"遅延評価だ…","ts":"1622028734.348600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"po72"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3a6cbabe-1b6c-4487-a64c-f4c7a8b6bc07","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"前の食事の洗い物が残った状態だと、次の食事に使う食器が間に合わないのでそのタイミングで洗わざるを得ない。","ts":"1622028717.348400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hVIfR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2c6a9aa8-8c6d-4250-9918-99d6a63eecb7","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"今週夜やることいろいろあったのでサボっててめっちゃ積んでる","ts":"1622028597.346500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZDh/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f73e23f8-2bf1-4f48-97b1-ad530dce81ae","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"皿洗い、習慣づいてやっていればサクサクいくけどちょっとサボって貯めるともう駄目","ts":"1622028558.346400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TdwU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"D9B97A1E-2998-4AF2-8549-6F5DC1AC5A2A","type":"message","user":"U843L486L","text":"暑くなってきたので冷豚シャブを作りました","ts":"1622027816.346100","files":[{"id":"F023ST5J5LG","created":1622027806,"timestamp":1622027806,"name":"iOS の画像.jpg","title":"iOS の画像","mimetype":"image/jpeg","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"jpg","pretty_type":"JPEG","user":"U843L486L","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":1206831,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F023ST5J5LG/ios__________.jpg","url_private_download":